{#- The counter signs' masthead: the logo on every sign, so they read as one
    set. Colour: the wordmark in a contained teal box. Black & white (`bw`):
    the same wordmark in solid black on the bare sheet (.wordmark--ink), over
    a rule. The outlined version is drawn to sit on teal and loses its
    outline in one ink; the solid one is the mark's own one-colour form. -#}
{%- if bw %}
<header class="sign-title-ink">
    <div class="wordmark wordmark--ink">
        {% inlineSvg "/assets/thecafe.svg", "", site.name %}
    </div>
</header>
{%- else %}
<header class="sign-mast">
    <div class="wordmark wordmark--light">
        {% inlineSvg "/assets/thecafe.svg", "", site.name %}
    </div>
</header>
{%- endif %}
